{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-01_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-01","title":"冤家易結","storyCode":"5-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9fa9211fd4e57d464ac3f3b941ada5a694304a6cf3bb203f7d9a13f0ca841e05","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以後我們就是朋友了。現在那些大人們，再也沒辦法欺負我們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別害怕，從今天開始無論發生什麼，我都會幫你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我遇到什麼壞事情，你可也一定要幫我哦！這就是朋友！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我們不會分開的，對吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得那個老公爵擄走她時你做了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你為了龍門能做到哪一步，是否真的什麼都可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，魏彥吾，你又要犧牲誰、犧牲什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警司，醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......讓我過去！讓我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"*龍門粗口*，我哪有時間和你這麼耗下去！"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘩啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_1_swire"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"噗，咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，快！整合運動——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"白日夢做夠了嗎？真是的，一臉敗相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼是你？我的隊伍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我說全滅了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"想挨打的話，建議去整合運動後面排隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴上功夫一直厲害得很，戰場上怎麼見不到你這麼凶？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼回事？我才走開一小會兒，你們兩個就又吵架吵成這個樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss.詩懷雅，少諷刺她兩句對你沒壞處，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳你也是，才剛醒就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你怎麼濕得跟剛被園藝車澆過一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你問她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“小姐”，這空杯子是怎麼回事？我記得我給你們兩個人各倒了一杯水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"她作夢的時候亂說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的某個艙室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"三刻鐘前，陳警司，你和你的小隊逃竄回了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能覺得你們把自己的行蹤隱藏得很好，但徘徊在龍門外圍的整合運動並不這麼想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["？？？","詩懷雅"]}]}
